est of the regular  season games and b georgia therein that  also means georgia would be in assuming  they don't lose to some ridiculous uh in  a ridiculous upset so then you only have  two spots left so you know cincinnati  better uh better have a bulldozer to  knock that door down if that's going to  be the case what happened to clemson  i think it's been coming for a while uh  they lost uh one of the one of their  coordinators to uh usf a couple years  ago and i think  it affected their  their play calling a little bit uh i  think sometimes these things get stale  uh and you know they lost a collection  of quarterbacks that go by the name of  deshawn watson and trevor lawrence and i  think just to expect the next guy is  going to walk in there and they also  forgot to recruit premier offensive  lineman  and when you're a new quarterback that  does not work very well what happened to  lsu  uh what happened to lsu is that joe  burrow left and so did about six or  seven other first-round  picks and just because you recruit five  stars doesn't mean you develop them i  mean since joe burrow left his last game  uh ed ogeron  is  is eight and eight  and it's about to get worse uh because  they have florida alabama arkansas and  ole miss and a m  and i i don't i'm not even sure they're  going to have a winning season and  and it is as crazy as this may sound dan  not to you  you follow college football in the south  uh two years after a national before the  two-year anniversary of a national  championship uh co-show could be out and  if you ask has that ever happened before  yes  it happened before 2012 gene chiswick  fired who was this quarterback two years  earlier cam newton  yeah we were talking about that earlier  paulie and i were that you know you lose  that quarterback but you lose borrow you  lose your quarterbacks coach as well  with joe burrow and i was told that you  know coach o is going to be out because  unless he would somehow be able to land  arch manning that uh you know the the  sweepstakes are pretty high with alabama  clemson texas might be the the front  runners for arch manning but i don't  know i just can't imagine that uh coach  oh is going to survive even after two  years here  i think arch manning's still in the  eighth grade yeah i'm not sure  but  yeah i i don't think he'll be around  very i mean  they they they love this guy and you you  probably have interviewed him before he  he's hard not to like but i think he's a  very average football coach and and lsu  needs something spectacular uh and they  they do not have that right now  are you all in on the big ten  i'm i'm starting to uh watch a lot more  big ten network it took me a long time  to find it dan but the big ten is the  story of college football i'm sure i'll  get a pink slip today from the sec  network for saying that but hey i'm sure  they're not paying attention right now  and yeah there are so many great stories  and and i think the story that we buried  five weeks ago may come back and be the  big 10 champion and and that's ohio  state they are looking alive again  and and i i think the schedule suits  them quite nicely are you all in on  michigan your good buddy jim harbaugh  i i don't know what you're talking about  yeah if i'm just thinking dan i need  some help here because you you've handed  out nba trophies and nfl trophies and  i've never really had to deal with stuff  like that but if somehow jim harbaugh  wins the national championship i'm i'm  looking for a country to uh to evacuate  to  i i just don't think it's going to be  safe for the two of us to live in the  great united states of america  if you ran usc's football program or usc  athletics what would you do  as your head coach  i would hire james franklin uh i think  he he checks a lot of boxes in in the  sense that he's a very good ceo which  means he'll bring in a top flight staff  and from there i i think  this this program needs to be run like a  like a big time operation and it hasn't  been and i think some of the problem is  they've had inept athletic directors out  there in the past they don't anymore  they hired mike bone from cincinnati and  and and in l.a  dan you you have to be able to schmooze  and and james franklin is very smooth  and i i expect that program to come back  big and i think he would be the best  choice every time i bring this up  because i had a source who told me that  whatever whenever they fired clay hey  james franklin stops on their list and  then the people at penn state are mad at  me because i bring up james franklin i'm  thinking  take it as a compliment like your coach  will be in demand he's either going to  get a new contract at penn state or  he'll get a contract at usc  i can't believe college football fans  get mad at commentators for speaking the  truth that is that's a new one um  yeah i i if if i'm over if i'm over at  penn state right now i'd be lit i'd be  i'd be searching the yellow pages for a  new coach because i think franklin is  leaving  paul always great to talk to you thank  you buddy  dan it was my pleasure thank you that's  paul feinbaum host of the paul feinbaum  show on the mother ship voice of the sec

